Provenance of this file: the standard MIT text with the copyright line of the
Mol* project (https://github.com/molstar/molstar), written here from the
project's published licence. It was NOT downloaded with the two bundle files
(only molstar.js and molstar.css were fetched), so the wording of the upstream
LICENSE file is recalled, not verified in this checkout. See README.md and
DATA.md for what was verified (file size, sha256, version string, the licence
notices of third-party code embedded in the bundle).

molstar.js also embeds code under other MIT-style licences whose notices are in
the minified file itself (for example "MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 Equinor",
"Copyright (c) 2017 Simon Rodriguez", normalize.css in molstar.css), and its
banner points to molstar.js.LICENSE.txt, which was not downloaded.
